    "content": "Pareto: $GOGL - Decent quarter – negative revisions coming (as expected). In sum, a slightly positive report from GOGL today, with underlying Q2 performance marginally ahead of our estimates. We expect to make few estimate changes though, with Q3 and Q4 consensus likely to come down significantly – and thus the very sharp contango in 2024 estimates becoming very visible. While GOGL is in a decent position and still able to pay out $0.10/share a quarter (6% yield), we still struggle to see the immediate triggers here. The company highlights its low break-even and ‘record low orderbook’, with limited demand visibility as Chinese demand remains uncertain. HOLD TP NOK 80, we expect to make only very limited revisions.",
